   "transcript_text": "Afternoon, doctor. I wanted to get constant thirst looked at. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I'm on metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day. It's telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day. For about three months, I'd say i'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. Tiredness goes along with it, most of the time. Oh, the Tiredness? That's been for about three months. A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then. Any sign of foot sores? I haven't noticed any foot sores. Neurologically, anything strange? No, that's all normal. Nothing on the skin, no.",
